    "detailed_description": "<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1407210/extras/1b161f41ab094ba7db81565087d58900.avif?t=1749220974\" /></div><br><br>In <i>Space Rescue</i> you play as Keen - a shy mechanic that just landed his first job on a 'Rescue &amp; Relax' ship. Keen's task is simple, make repairs wherever needed!  But everytime Keen lends a hand, he always ends up in ever stranger and more sexy adventures! And so the real question is  - can Keen keep a cool head as he attempts to fulfil his crewmates needs? Or will things run hot beyond his control!<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1407210/extras/94e8691f65d4646c9f066c981f2828c2.poster.avif?t=1749220974\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1407210/extras/94e8691f65d4646c9f066c981f2828c2.webm?t=1749220974\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1407210/extras/94e8691f65d4646c9f066c981f2828c2.mp4?t=1749220974\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br><strong>Gameplay</strong><br><br>Space Rescue is an <strong>easy adventure game</strong>, where you\u2019ll be exploring spaceships, gathering items, and playing the occasional mini-game. <br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1407210/extras/6a1ae08a025cab182c87eb87eead92c2.poster.avif?t=1749220974\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1407210/extras/6a1ae08a025cab182c87eb87eead92c2.webm?t=1749220974\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1407210/extras/6a1ae08a025cab182c87eb87eead92c2.m